#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:409
msgid "Autotype Initial Delay"
msgstr "Indledende autoskrivforsinkelse"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:410
msgid "Milliseconds to wait before typing starts"
msgstr "Millisekunder at vente før skrivning begynder"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:417
msgid "Dynamic resolution"
msgstr "Dynamisk opløsning"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:419
msgid ""
"Resize the remote desktop to match the window (External client). Turn off "
"for legacy servers"
msgstr ""
"Tilpas fjernskrivebordet til vinduet (ekstern klient). Slå fra for ældre "
"servere"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:427
msgid "Smart sizing"
msgstr "Smart tilpasning"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:429
msgid ""
"Scale the remote screen to fit the window (External client). For legacy "
"servers on HiDPI displays. Overrides dynamic resolution"
msgstr ""
"Skalér fjernskærmen til at passe til vinduet (ekstern klient). Til ældre "
"servere på HiDPI-skærme. Tilsidesætter dynamisk opløsning"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:448
msgid "Reconnect on Resize"
msgstr "Genopret forbindelse ved størrelsesændring"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:450
msgid ""
"Full reconnect instead of dynamic resize (Embedded client). For legacy "
"servers or fixed resolution"
msgstr ""
"Fuld genforbindelse i stedet for dynamisk størrelsesændring (indlejret "
"klient). Til ældre servere eller fast opløsning"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:458
#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/vnc.rs:294
msgid ""
"Use multiple network paths for seamless mobility (Linux 5.6+, embedded mode "
"only)"
msgstr ""
"Brug flere netværksstier for problemfri mobilitet (Linux 5.6+, kun indlejret "
"tilstand)"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:460
#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/vnc.rs:296
msgid ""
"Multiple network paths (embedded mode only). Not available: kernel MPTCP is "
"disabled"
msgstr ""
"Flere netværksstier (kun indlejret tilstand). Ikke tilgængelig: kerne-MPTCP "
"er deaktiveret"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:463
#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/ssh.rs:706
#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/vnc.rs:299
msgid "Multipath TCP"
msgstr "Multipath TCP"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:471
msgid "FIDO2 Passkey Redirection"
msgstr "Videresending af FIDO2-adgangsnøgler"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:473
msgid ""
"Use local security keys in the remote session (External client, FreeRDP 3.x)"
msgstr ""
"Brug lokale sikkerhedsnøgler i fjernsessionen (ekstern klient, FreeRDP 3.x)"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:485
msgid "Admin/console session (/admin)"
msgstr "Administrator-/konsolsession (/admin)"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:487
msgid ""
"Connect to the console/admin session (External client). Bypasses RDS CAL "
"licensing"
msgstr ""
"Opret forbindelse til konsol-/administratorsessionen (ekstern klient). Omgår "
"RDS CAL-licensering"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:492
msgid ""
"Passes /admin to the external FreeRDP client, connecting to the server's "
"console/administrative session instead of a normal RDS session. This "
"bypasses RDS CAL licensing. External client only; the embedded client cannot "
"request it yet."
msgstr ""
"Sender /admin til den eksterne FreeRDP-klient og opretter forbindelse til "
"serverens konsol-/administrative session i stedet for en normal RDS-session. "
"Dette omgår RDS CAL-licensering. Kun ekstern klient; den indlejrede klient "
"kan ikke anmode om det endnu."

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:503
msgid "Kerberos Authentication"
msgstr "Kerberos-godkendelse"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:505
msgid ""
"Required for AD \"Protected Users\"; Host must be the server's DNS name. "
"Embedded client: Kerberos only, with the saved password. External client: "
"FreeRDP tries Kerberos itself, and RemoteApp is no longer limited to NTLM"
msgstr ""
"Kræves til AD “Protected Users”; værten skal være serverens DNS-navn. "
"Indbygget klient: kun Kerberos, med den gemte adgangskode. Ekstern klient: "
"FreeRDP prøver selv Kerberos, og RemoteApp er ikke længere begrænset til NTLM"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:517
msgid "KDC Address"
msgstr "KDC-adresse"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:519
msgid ""
"Optional. A domain controller name or IP address, a tcp:// or udp:// "
"address, or an https:// KDC proxy URL. Leave empty to find it automatically. "
"The External client uses only an https://…/KdcProxy proxy and otherwise "
"follows the system Kerberos configuration."
msgstr ""
"Valgfrit. Et domænecontrollernavn eller en IP-adresse, en tcp:// eller "
"udp://-adresse, eller en https:// KDC-proxy-URL. Lad stå tomt for at finde "
"den automatisk. Den eksterne klient bruger kun en https://…/KdcProxy-proxy "
"og følger ellers systemets Kerberos-konfiguration."

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:534
msgid "Disable NLA"
msgstr "Deaktiver NLA"

#: rustconn/src/dialogs/connection/rdp.rs:535
msgid "Skip Network Level Authentication (less secure)"
msgstr "Spring netværksniveaugodkendelse over (mindre sikkert)"

